menu "Locker USB console"

    config LC_BENCH_CONSOLE
        bool "Bench console: configure, unlock, command and reset-network"
        default y
        help
            The bench console can commission a unit, send an unlock to the
            panel and queue commands over USB. A production build turns this
            off (sdkconfig.production): those four commands then do not exist,
            and a unit is commissioned through the setup network and reset with
            the button (ADR-0074). Development and bench builds keep it on.

endmenu
